        "identity": {
          "graphId": "type-and-instance-presentation-task"
        },
        "title": "Implementation Notes",
        "markdown": "# Type and Instance Presentation\n\n**Status:** Reopened and blocked on repository access\n\nThe design remains accepted: **the Legend explains what can be created; Elements shows what currently exists.** The previous code is useful as a prototype, but it was not implemented in the repository that powers Twilite.\n\n## Correct implementation target\n\n- Repository: `github://TwiliteLLC/twilite`\n- Branch: `dev-master`\n\n## What happened\n\n- The reference implementation was completed in `github://mikemartinez1974/nodegraph-editor` at `45ebe4d708c77c3b95a6370febe0d088da908351`.\n- A whole-file port into the correct repository produced commit `886a66c9fbbb6399c278f90a4e51e9f4decf28e7`.\n- The production build failed while prerendering `/browser` with `ReferenceError: ViewPlugin is not defined`.\n- The failed release never activated. The live checkout remained `783a82773ba2dafc8f12f81d7c1218fd7bc9c69c`.\n- `dev-master` was restored to the known-good deployed code.\n\n## Next move\n\nInspect the current Twilite implementation first, then reapply the contract surgically so existing CodeMirror, Elements-panel, and browser behavior remain intact.",
        "reopenedAt": "2026-08-05T01:10:00.000Z"
      }
    }
